{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Co-Op Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Box Zombies is a split-screen co-op game.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore randomly generated maps, build defenses with sentry guns, barricades, and mines, and enjoy a fresh experience every round as you never know what weapon stores there will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New to gaming?</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a problem! Box Zombies has simple controls that are easy to learn for non-gamers, making it an ideal party game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Should You Play Box Zombies?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Designed for Co-Op:</strong> Ideal split-screen party game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Simple Controls:</strong>\u00a0Perfect for casual gaming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fresh Gameplay:</strong> Randomly generated maps, day / night cycles, &amp; more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer &amp; split-screen co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated &amp; pre-made maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, perfect for non-gamers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ Characters to unlock </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day &amp; night cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great for parties</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Frequently Asked Questions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: What kind of game is Box Zombies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Box Zombies is a survival sandbox with an emphasis on teamwork, exploration, and simple-yet-chaotic fun.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Is there online co-op?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: No, Box Zombies is designed for split-screen on a single device only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Can blood be turned off?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Yes, navigate to the Settings menu in the game to find an option to turn blood off.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Q: Is this the equivalent product as the mobile app with the same name? <br>A: Yes and no. It is the same game, but this version is almost entirely rewritten resulting in a much more stable experience, but essentially an entirely different product than the mobile version. Your stats will not carry over.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Note from the Developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for considering Box Zombies. This game is a spiritual successor to a game I have very fond memories of as a kid, and I hope Box Zombies brings you the same enjoyment I had. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my passion project, and it has been quite the learning experience. I love reading your feedback and seeing what ideas you have, so please reach out to me if anything comes to mind or if you encounter any bugs. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thanks For Playing!</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Better Together","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892230/7af37e18cacb97504ff5a27f1d3a3163d63a4820.jpg"},{"name":"Locked \u2018n Loaded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892230/41e5c2ae7e33c410980a31b5c38054132bea6a14.jpg"},{"name":"Feel the Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892230/fc46814d3a70eea4cf2e07d683e62eab3b87282d.jpg"},{"name":"I Ain\u2019t Worried","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2892230/0836f30b3679c59728ae739a2c6ca8f4fe620069.jpg"},{"name":"Party Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps