 Zombies is designed for split-screen on a single device only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Can blood be turned off?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Yes, navigate to the Settings menu in the game to find an option to turn blood off.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Q: Is this the equivalent product as the mobile app with the same name? <br>A: Yes and no. It is the same game, but this version is almost entirely rewritten resulting in a much more stable experience, but essentially an entirely different product than the mobile version. Your stats will not carry over.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Note from the Developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for considering Box Zombies. This game is a spiritual successor to a game I have very fond memories of as a kid, and I hope Box Zombies brings you the same enjoyment I had. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my passion project, and it has been quite the learning experience. I love reading your feedback and seeing what ideas you have, so please reach out to me if anything comes to mind or if you encounter any bugs. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thanks For Playing!</h2>","developers":["TheGreenSquier"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892230/1eebec19816d67ef061d8776500fab954d162d14/header.jpg?t=1755632020","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2892230/1268339451/af7435ab5dcd082c541ea8aca977683abd1b8003/1753911737/d